{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24672","headline":"开龙门八节石滩诗二首 二 · 白居易","name":"开龙门八节石滩诗二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"七十三翁旦暮身，誓开险路作通津。\n夜舟过此无倾覆，朝胫从今免苦辛。\n十里叱滩变河汉，八寒阴狱化阳春。\n我身虽殁心长在，闇施慈悲与後人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24672.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24672","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}